Apple today <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NQQqInahTAM">shared a trailer</a> for "<a href="https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/originals/outcome/">Outcome</a>," a dark comedy film starring Keanu Reeves, Jonah Hill, Cameron Diaz, David Spade, Martin Scorsese, and others. The original film will be <a href="http://tv.apple.com/">available to stream on Apple TV</a> starting Friday, April 10.<br/>
<br/>
